Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:26:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [Anti Detection] Prevent private ABI exposed
 to 3rd party apps

Some detector (e.g. Duck Detector) will check the exported symbols of libstagfright, which are judged as a
sign of custom ROM

Change-Id: I4a481c32a6ff2cb51ac905e598bf398435f65cbf
